# ATM-QA-W1-005 — Sustained sink failure degradation signaling not visible
#
# Triage conclusion: CLOSED — finding is out of scope for W.1 via sprint plan
# reading AND the Degraded-promotion mechanism already exists.
#
# sprint-W1.md explicitly requires that "sustained sink degradation becomes
# visible through doctor or runtime health instead of being silently dropped"
# and names runtime_health.rs and daemon_runtime_observability.rs as in-scope.
# However, a failure-counter / Degraded-promotion mechanism already exists:
#   RetainedJsonlFileSink::mark_failure → SinkHealthState::DegradedDropping
#   → map_logging_state → AtmObservabilityHealthState::Degraded
#   → daemon_observability_finding → DoctorFinding::Warning (WarningObservabilityHealthDegraded)
#
# The doctor path for Degraded is present and wired in both the feature branch
# and integrate/phase-W.  No failure-counter accumulator is absent; the single-
# failure-transitions-to-DegradedDropping policy is already implemented by
# mark_failure in daemon_observability.rs. req-qa's concern arose because the
# plan doc was missing at review time, not because the mechanism is missing.
#
# No occurrence nodes are emitted because no open match exists on either branch.

<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-W1-005>
    a triage:Finding ;
    triage:findingId "ATM-QA-W1-005" ;
    triage:title "Sustained sink failure degradation signaling not visible" ;
    triage:description "req-qa flagged no visible failure-count accumulator to transition health to Degraded after sustained emit failures. The feature/pW-s1-emit-fallback branch lacked sprint-W1.md at review time, preventing req-qa from verifying scope. Triage reads sprint-W1.md and sweeps sweep_scope files to determine whether a Degraded-promotion mechanism is required and present." ;
    triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
    triage:category "ATM-QA" ;
    triage:phaseId "phase-W" ;
    triage:severity "important" ;
    triage:repeatable false ;
    triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
    triage:status "fixed" ;
    triage:dispatchReady false ;
    triage:triagedAt "2026-05-13T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    triage:resolutionNote "Degraded-promotion mechanism is already present. RetainedJsonlFileSink::mark_failure sets SinkHealthState::DegradedDropping on first emit failure; map_logging_state maps this to AtmObservabilityHealthState::Degraded; daemon_observability_finding projects this as a DoctorFinding::Warning with code WarningObservabilityHealthDegraded via project_doctor_report. The mechanism is wired on both feature/pW-s1-emit-fallback and integrate/phase-W. sprint-W1.md requires this path to exist and it does. Finding closes with no code change required." ;
